prompts.text:
Create a flashcard deck for the topic I provide. Use plain English and one idea per card. Test recall, reasoning, common mistakes, and transfer to a new situation. Make the front a specific question and the back a concise answer with a brief explanation. Avoid MCQs and vague prompts. Use Markdown when useful and LaTeX for math; escape LaTeX backslashes in JSON. Return only a JSON code block with this structure:
{"name":"Topic","cards":[{"front":"A focused question?","back":"A clear answer and why it works.","tags":["topic"]}]}
Topic: [paste your topic or source here]

Create 5 connected Concept Breakdown Quiz questions that build reasoning toward this problem, ending with transfer. Use plain English. Honor CBQ/ modes in the source (default mental/depth; 5x25 means 5 core ideas + 25 questions). Include answers and concise explanations; optional hints. Return only a JSON code block using this ExamFlow structure (MCQs: 2 options, answer A or B). Escape LaTeX backslashes in JSON.
{"name":"CBQ","sections":[{"name":"Reasoning","timeMinutes":10,"marks":1,"negativeMarks":0,"questions":[{"type":"mcq","question":"…","options":["…","…"],"answer":"A","explanation":"…"}]}]}
Source: {{question}}
